{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:20218-1","published":"2026-02-02T10:21:13Z","modified":"2026-03-23T04:52:44.501799Z","related":["CVE-2025-23259"],"upstream":["CVE-2025-23259"],"summary":"Security update for dpdk","details":"This update for dpdk fixes the following issues:\n\nUpdate to version 24.11.4.\n\nSecurity issues fixed:\n\n- CVE-2025-23259: issue in the Poll Mode Driver (PMD) allows an attacker on a VM in the system to leak information and\n  cause a denial of service on the network interface (bsc#1254161).\n\nOther issues fixed:\n\n- Remove obsolete build option -Denable_kmods.\n- Add \"which\" as a build requirement.\n- Drop pesign and needssslcertforbuild because we don't build a kmp anymore (bsc#1247389).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"dpdk","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server 16.0","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/dpdk&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%2016.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"24.11.4-160000.1.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"dpdk":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-devel":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-devel-static":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-doc":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-tools":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","libdpdk-25":"24.11.4-160000.1.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:20218-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"dpdk","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server for SAP applications 16.0","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/dpdk&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%20for%20SAP%20applications%2016.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"24.11.4-160000.1.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"dpdk":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-devel":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-devel-static":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-doc":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","dpdk-tools":"24.11.4-160000.1.1","libdpdk-25":"24.11.4-160000.1.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:20218-1.json"}}],"references":